Subject: [PATCH 36/46] video: choose the logo file and position in Kconfig;
 Pomera logo tools

VIDEO_LOGO_FILE replaces drivers/video/u_boot_logo.bmp, and
VIDEO_LOGO_X/Y replace the fixed -4/4 placement (defaults unchanged).
mklogo.py turns a PNG into the 8-bit RLE8 BMP U-Boot draws, makes a
1024x600 test chart, and previews a BMP the way U-Boot places it.

